---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Support for Single Parents | Marietta Childcare"
  description="Learn how Marietta Childcare provides flexible scheduling, affordable options, and supportive community for single parent families.">
  <section class="relative py-32 overflow-hidden w-screen -ml-[calc((100vw-100%)/2)]">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 z-0">
      <img 
        src="/images/Background_Images/diverse_children_sharing_toy_background.jpg" 
        alt="Single parent support" 
        class="w-full h-full object-cover"
      />
      <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/40"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-[1280px] mx-auto px-6 lg:px-20">
      <h1 class="text-4xl lg:text-6xl font-black mb-6 text-white drop-shadow-lg">Support for Single Parents</h1>
      <p class="text-lg mb-12 max-w-2xl text-white drop-shadow-md">Flexible scheduling, affordable options, and supportive community for single parent families.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 px-6 lg:px-20">
    <div class="max-w-[1280px] mx-auto">
      <article class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        
        <p class="text-xl text-gray-600 mb-8">Marietta Childcare provides compassionate support for single parents. Marietta Childcare recognizes the unique challenges single parents face and offers solutions tailored to their needs.</p>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Flexible Scheduling Solutions</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare offers flexible scheduling to accommodate single parent work arrangements. Flexible scheduling at Marietta Childcare supports various employment situations. Marietta Childcare's adaptable programs work with single parent schedules.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's flexibility reduces stress for single parents managing multiple responsibilities. Flexible care at Marietta Childcare allows single parents to focus on work and family. Marietta Childcare's scheduling options support single parent success.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Affordable Childcare Options</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides affordable childcare options for single parents. Affordable programs at Marietta Childcare make quality care accessible. Marietta Childcare recognizes that single parents often have limited budgets.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare accepts childcare subsidy vouchers and financial assistance programs. Financial support at Marietta Childcare helps single parents access quality care. Marietta Childcare's affordable options ensure children receive excellent care regardless of family income.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Supportive Community Environment</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare creates a supportive community for single parent families. Community at Marietta Childcare includes understanding staff and inclusive policies. Marietta Childcare's environment welcomes all family structures.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff recognizes and respects single parent contributions. Supportive relationships at Marietta Childcare reduce single parent isolation. Marietta Childcare's community approach strengthens single parent families.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Reliable, Consistent Care</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides reliable, consistent care single parents can depend on. Consistent care at Marietta Childcare reduces single parent stress about childcare stability. Marietta Childcare's reliable service supports single parent planning.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's dependable operations ensure single parents can maintain work commitments. Reliability at Marietta Childcare allows single parents to focus on family and career. Marietta Childcare's consistent approach supports single parent confidence.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Communication and Partnership</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare maintains open communication with single parent families. Communication at Marietta Childcare keeps single parents informed about children's development. Marietta Childcare's partnership approach values single parent input.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's staff works collaboratively with single parents. Partnership at Marietta Childcare includes regular updates and conferences. Marietta Childcare's communication supports single parent involvement in children's education.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Quality Education and Care</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare provides quality education and care for all children. Quality programming at Marietta Childcare supports children's development. Marietta Childcare's curriculum prepares children for kindergarten and beyond.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's commitment to quality ensures children thrive. Quality care at Marietta Childcare supports children's social-emotional development. Marietta Childcare's excellence benefits all families, including single parent families.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="mb-12">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Emergency and Backup Support</h2>
          <p>Marietta Childcare understands that single parents sometimes need emergency support. Emergency procedures at Marietta Childcare address unexpected situations. Marietta Childcare's staff works with single parents during challenging times.</p>
          <p>Marietta Childcare's flexible policies accommodate single parent emergencies. Support at Marietta Childcare extends beyond regular childcare services. Marietta Childcare's commitment to single parents includes crisis support.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="bg-blue-50 p-6 rounded-lg mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">We Support Your Family</h3>
          <p class="mb-4">Marietta Childcare is committed to supporting single parent families. Contact Marietta Childcare to learn how Marietta Childcare can provide the support and care your family needs.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="inline-block bg-blue-600 text-white px-6 py-3 rounded-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-700 transition">Schedule a Tour</a>
        </section>

        <nav class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-gray-200">
          <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-4">Related Pages</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-2">
            <li><a href="/solutions/working-parents" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Solutions for Working Parents</a></li>
            <li><a href="/solutions/budget-conscious" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Affordable Childcare Options</a></li>
            <li><a href="/faq/how-much-childcare-cost" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">How Much Does Childcare Cost?</a></li>
            <li><a href="/programs" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Our Programs</a></li>
            <li><a href="/contact" class="text-blue-600 hover:text-blue-800">Contact Marietta Childcare</a></li>
          </ul>
        </nav>
      </article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
